# Stops UBT's default recursive walk into `Inner/` so the UCLASS-bearing source
# isn't scanned on engines without the ToolsetRegistry plugin. Re-enabled from
# SMAssistToolset.Build.cs via ConditionalAddModuleDirectory when the engine
# ships ToolsetRegistry (UE 5.8+). Without this marker the UCLASS subclasses
# UToolsetDefinition unconditionally and the build fails on older engines.
